195	  <h1>Batch 10, designed blind</h1>
196	  <p class="lede">Four designers each wrote a workflow for climb batch 10 from its goals. The first two saw parts of our pipeline; two more, at your word, worked blind. Nothing they wrote was run. This page sets the four designs beside the pipeline batch 10 is running on now.</p>
