344	    <h3>The leak that remains: CLAUDE.md</h3>
345	    <ul>
346	      <li><b>CLAUDE.md reaches every agent.</b> No brief can hold it back <span class="src">Study</span>.</li>
347	      <li>It names the collaboration protocol, the coordinator's plan and knowledge base, and the folder of the gate summaries, <code>explorations/compile-ladder/climb-batch-*/gate/summary.txt</code>. It calls the test suite, <code>testFast</code> and <code>testSystem</code>, "the gate for every change".</li>
348	      <li>It shows. Both blind designs put their report in <code>explorations/compile-ladder/climb-batch-10/</code>, with a <code>gate/summary.txt</code> <span class="src">Blind Fable §5</span> <span class="src">Blind Opus §5</span>. The ledger, which they read, names such folders too.</li>
349	      <li>It names none of the pipeline's roles (worker, skeptic, judge, gather) and no token cost.</li>
350	    </ul>
